    <h1>Playwright vs Selenium in 2026: Which One Should You Choose?</h1>
    <p class="post-hero-lead">Playwright has overtaken Selenium as the default choice for most new web automation projects. Here is a direct comparison to help you decide which one is right for your situation – without the hype.</p>
