    <p>I have been doing web automation for nine years. I have built Selenium frameworks in Java, Python, and Ruby. I have migrated teams from Selenium to Playwright and, in a couple of cases, from Playwright back to a Selenium/Playwright hybrid. I have opinions about this, and I will try to make them useful rather than just telling you that Playwright is newer and therefore better.</p>
    <p>The short answer: Playwright is the right choice for most new projects starting in 2026. But "most" is not "all," and the cases where Selenium is still the right answer are real, not theoretical.</p>

